<view class="page privacy-page">
  <view class="privacy-hero card"><view class="shield"><image src="/assets/icons/shield.png" mode="aspectFit"/></view><view><view class="title">数据边界看得见，也能自己控制</view><view class="subtitle">这里不是一段“隐私政策文案”，而是直接连接真实的数据导出、删除和安全边界。</view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state-card"><view class="state-spinner"></view><view><view class="state-title">正在读取当前环境的数据策略</view><view class="state-desc">不会读取或展示 API Key 明文</view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="state-card state-card-error"><view><view class="state-title">暂时无法读取</view><view class="state-desc">{{error}}</view></view></view>
  <block wx:if="{{policy}}">
    <view class="section-title">数据在哪里</view><view class="card"><view class="policy-row"><text>数据库</text><text>{{policy.database}}</text></view><view class="policy-row"><text>图片 / 视频</text><text>{{policy.media_storage}}</text></view><view class="policy-row"><text>访问密钥</text><text>{{policy.api_key}}</text></view><view class="policy-row"><text>图片处理</text><text>{{policy.ai_processing}}</text></view><view class="policy-row"><text>服务日志</text><text>{{policy.logs}}</text></view></view>
    <view class="section-title">医疗安全边界</view><view class="card boundary"><view class="boundary-title">HealthMate 不做这些事</view><view class="boundary-item"><image src="/assets/icons/close.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>疾病诊断与“确诊”结论</text></view><view class="boundary-item"><image src="/assets/icons/close.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>处方、停药、换药或剂量调整</text></view><view class="boundary-item"><image src="/assets/icons/close.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>极端节食、催吐或泻药减重方案</text></view><view class="boundary-item"><image src="/assets/icons/close.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>在急症 / 自伤风险下继续生成训练计划</text></view><view class="boundary-foot">高风险审计默认只保留规则类别、消息哈希和脱敏片段。</view></view>
    <view class="section-title">你的数据权利</view><view class="card action-card"><view class="row space"><view><view class="info-title">导出个人数据</view><view class="muted action-desc">ZIP / JSON · 不包含 API Key 明文</view></view><button class="btn-soft action-btn tappable" bindtap="exportData" loading="{{exporting}}" hover-class="tap-btn" hover-start-time="0" hover-stay-time="80">导出</button></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="counts">当前导出范围包含 {{preview.counts.diet_records||0}} 条饮食、{{preview.counts.exercise_records||0}} 条运动、{{preview.counts.timeline||0}} 条 Timeline 事件。</view></view>
    <view class="card danger-zone"><view class="danger-title">删除账户与全部数据</view><view class="muted danger-desc">二次确认后删除数据库中的个人记录和对象存储中的媒体文件。该操作不可撤销。</view><button class="danger-btn tappable" bindtap="deleteAccount" loading="{{deleting}}" hover-class="tap-btn" hover-start-time="0" hover-stay-time="80">永久删除我的数据</button></view>
  </block>
</view>
